Body:
Just ran into this issue; the culprit was the config in `~/.ollama/config.json` still referencing previous models:

```json
{
  "integrations": {
    "opencode": {
      "models": [
        "codegemma"
      ]
    }
  },
  "last_selection": "run"
}
```

Removing this file is enough for `ollama launch opencode` to work as intended.

So it seems to be a bug on the Ollama integration, not on OpenCode.
